          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">At the End of your Movement Phase, Pick a Friendly Infantry Or Calvery Model within 3&quot; of the Apothacary. Roll a D6 on a 4+ return 1 Destroyed model to the Unit or return D3 lost wounds to a model in the unit. If a Friendly Unit was destroyed within 6&quot; of the Apothacary this turn roll a D6 on a 5+ gain 1 CP.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
