          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Once per battle, at the start of the Fight phase, this model can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase, add 3 to the Attacks characteristic of melee weapons equipped by this model and those weapons have the [DEVASTATING WOUNDS] ability.</characteristic>
