          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">At the end of the Fight phase, if there are any other friendly units within 3&quot; of this model, roll one D6: on a 1, select one of those units. That unit suffers 2 mortal wounds.
In a Boarding Action, this ability only affects friendly units that are visible to this model.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Legendary Killer (Aura)" typeId="10e3-235b-fd89-87a6" typeName="Abillities" hidden="false" id="14e4-9c35-534d-7e27">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">While a friendly WORLD EATERS CORE unit is within 6&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit makes an attack, re-roll a wound roll of 1.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
