                  <characteristics>
                    <characteristic name="Description" typeId="a1eb-0258-504f-a2f2">Each time this model fights, if it made a charge move, was charged, or performed a Heroic Intervention this turn, then until that fight is resolved, add 1 to this model&apos;s Strength and Attacks characteristic.</characteristic>
